  "description": "The Vaporesso XROS 4 Mini Kit offers a super-stylish vape experience in a smooth, sleek compact form factor with high-performance features. This device is crafted with a durable aluminium alloy body and powered by an impressive 1000mAh battery, providing ample power for extended vaping sessions. Equipped with the advanced Corex 2.0 technology, the XROS 4 Mini enhances flavour production and coil longevity, ensuring a premium vaping experience with every puff. The kit includes a 0.6ohm pod that provides a rich and airy RDTL (direct-to-lung) experience when used with High-VG e-liquids. Vaporesso’s new generation of XROS Corex 2.0 replacement pods ( sold separately ) cater to a variety of different vaping styles, with a range of pods featuring 0.6, 0.8, 1.0 and 1.2 coils allowing for DTL, RDTL (restricted direct-to-lung) and MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping styles. Kits Update: All kits now come with 0.6om Corex 2.0 pod. We recommend pairing the included pod with the following E-Liquid RDL/MTL Xros Series 0.6ohm pod - 50/50 (freebase) or Nic Salts E-Liquid . Please note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
